title: ecommerce-seo-playbook
message: >-
  If you use or reference this documentation, please cite it
  using the metadata below.
abstract: >-
  Original documentation for e-commerce SEO on WooCommerce and
  WordPress stores: indexation, faceted navigation, catalogue
  architecture, search intent, the product lifecycle, internal
  linking, images, performance and structured data, with
  checklists, templates and worked examples. Written from a
  store operations and content perspective rather than an
  engineering one.
